<title>HONG KONG: HK's Perennial says IPO 2.03 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>HK's Perennial says IPO 2.03 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical cable manufacturer Perennial International Ltd said on Friday its initial public offering (IPO) was about 2.03 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The company offered 60 million shares, consisting of 40 million new shares and 20 million existing shares, at HK$1.07 each. Dealing in the shares is due to begin on December 30.</p>
<p>A portion of six million shares reserved for employees was fully subscribed, Perennial said.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds of the issue would be used to boost production capacity, purchase machinery, repay debt and for working capital.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
